      "end_ms": 294040,
      "text": "这个瓷砖要1800元"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 294200,
      "end_ms": 298080,
      "text": "然后那个瓷砖工要1650元"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 298380,
